#pmix.h22                       5.3391725  1.42141207    2.55325604   8.1250890

This produces an estimate of N of 466.

My next model is:
#Beta parameters (coefficients)
#                         beta   SE.beta          lcl         ucl
#D                                -19.6258743 4.1766794 -27.81201546 -11.4397331
